        "created_at": "2015-12-31T18:42:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Clarification: without describing their APPEARANCE or PROFESSION. The goal is to describe the character traits.</p>\n<p>Example: C-3PO is haughty, fussy, and self-centered. He really does care about R2, even if he won’t ever admit it.</p>\n<p>The descriptions “protocol droid,” “translator,” or “golden” would not be allowed under these rules.</p>\n<p>Now, you. Qui-Gon Jinn. GO!</p>",
